  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Formulating, monitoring and reporting Colombia&apos;s NDC 3.0 enhancement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Colombia is currently in the process of updating its NDC, an exercise it has been working on since 2024 to include additional aspects with the goal of submitting it in October of this year. The Ministry of Environment has been leading this exercise with a specialized team, but due to the country&apos;s fiscal factors, this team does not have the resources to finance it from April 2025 onward. Except for specific support through the SPARC program, GGGI had not been able to support this process; however, this situation opens up the possibility of contributing to the exercise and establishing a more direct relationship with the Ministry.</narrative>
  </description>
